{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04224","headline":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋云 · 骆宾王","name":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南陆铜浑改，西郊玉叶轻。\n泛斗瑶光动，临阳瑞色明。\n盖阴连凤阙，阵影翼龙城。\n讵知时不遇，空伤流滞情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}